// Paper example 072: Dot product with matched dimensions

#noformat
#paper: 72
#mode: evaluation
#inlinetest:exclude Not an executable S_H/A example; see TestQuantifiedPaperIndex.
#skip
Dependent profile D (out of scope).

-- paper.cue.txt --
addNumber: func(x: number, y: number) -> number: x + y

dot(n in Nat): func(xs: Vec(number, n), ys: Vec(number, n)) ->
    number: fold(addNumber, 0, [for i, x in xs {x * ys[i]}])
